      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Star_Junction%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Star Junction lies on Pennsylvania Route 51, 2 miles north to Perryopolis and 13 miles south to Uniontown.",
